prompt.template:
The trip is over. You brought in {your_catch_kg:.0f}kg. Here's how everyone else in the community did:
{others_summary}

The lake now holds about {stock_kg:.0f}kg.

The whole community is going to agree on a shared rule for how the lake gets fished going forward. Propose one. State it as two parts: a short policy (the rule itself) and an operationalization (exactly how you'd expect it to work in practice — who does what, how often, what happens if someone doesn't follow it, if anything).

Respond with ONLY this JSON object, nothing else:
{{"policy": "<the rule, one or two sentences>", "operationalization": "<how it works in practice, a few sentences>", "reasoning": "<why you're proposing this, in character>"}}
